Selected Idea
-------------

Introduce Nuëyon: an AI-first company with Compose as its first concrete product
Present Nuëyon’s core proposition: an AI-first software company building reusable AI-native products for other AI-first businesses, with Nuëyon.Compose as the first focused expression of that vision. The piece explains who Nuëyon intends to serve, why it exists, what Compose does at a high level, and how the company plans to grow from a single product into a broader portfolio over time.

